# ARENA's requirements.txt (ARENA_materials @ eb82e92, 2026-09-17), with fixes.
# Changes from the original — each one because the original doesn't resolve or doesn't work:
#   - removed the cu118 --extra-index-url: PyTorch no longer builds CUDA 11.8 wheels.
#     The CUDA version is now chosen by the TORCH_BACKEND build arg in the Dockerfile.
#   - removed torchtext: deprecated, unused anywhere in ARENA, and would force torch 2.3.
#   - removed torchaudio: unused anywhere in ARENA, and no longer released in step with torch.
#   - removed the mujoco-py extra from gymnasium: legacy package, unused (ARENA uses `mujoco`).
#   - see overrides.txt for two version conflicts that make the original unresolvable.
